#: luci-app-router-role/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-role.js:62
msgid ""
"Automatic AP conversion requires plain Ethernet ports. Configure VLAN or "
"switch topologies manually."
msgstr "自动 AP 转换适用于普通以太网端口，VLAN 或传统交换机拓扑请手动配置。"

#: luci-app-router-role/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-role.js:58
msgid ""
"Cannot identify the Ethernet WAN device. Configure LAN/WAN devices first."
msgstr "无法确定有线 WAN 设备，请先配置 LAN/WAN 设备。"

#: luci-app-router-role/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-role.js:56
msgid "Cannot read board port assignments. Configure AP ports manually."
msgstr "无法读取板级网口配置，请手动配置 AP 网口。"

#: luci-app-router-role/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-role.js:232
msgid ""
"Manually enable to bridge all Ethernet ports and obtain IPv4/IPv6 from the "
"upstream router; disable to restore the previous settings. When disabled, "
"PPPoE automatically uses main-router mode and other WAN protocols use sub-"
"router mode."
msgstr ""
"手动启用后将全部网口桥接，从上级获取 IPv4/IPv6；取消后恢复之前的设置。未启用"
"时，PPPoE 自动采用主路由模式，其他 WAN 协议采用子路由模式。"

#: luci-app-router-role/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-role.js:131
msgid ""
"No free LAN subnet was found. Configure a non-overlapping IPv4 subnet "
"manually."
msgstr "未找到可用 LAN 网段，请手动设置与上级不重叠的 IPv4 网段。"

#: luci-app-router-role/root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-router-role.json:3
msgid "Read board Ethernet port assignments for router role presets"
msgstr "读取板级以太网端口配置，用于路由器角色预设"

#: luci-app-router-role/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-role.js:231
msgid "Relay AP mode"
msgstr "中继AP模式"

#: luci-app-router-role/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/router-role.js:184
msgid ""
"The saved configuration is missing. Restore LAN/WAN settings manually before "
"disabling AP mode."
msgstr "恢复记录缺失，请先手动还原 LAN/WAN 设置，再取消 AP 模式。"
